        "TileImage": "$($repository aa7a67df-8112-4578-b70a-322270626529).Image",
        "Description": "Price: 47, we located the Russian President, he is kept hostage at a maximum security blacksite deep underground the city of Chongqing. Hannan has been using this facility as a base of operations ever since the war broke out. If we want to have a chance at getting the President out, you will have to first take out the operators of  the main security system so Delta and SAS can breach without further notice. \rThis won&apos;t be easy, but we are close to the finish line. We will end this war tonight.",
